<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 881)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Tool Palette</b> is in the View menu (and the right-click menu), with a check mark. <b>P</b> shows the palette even when the setting had turned it off, instead of toggling a hide nobody could see.</li>
<li><b>Fit to Window</b> ticks when the picture is at fit, like the zooms; the right-click menu ticks them too.</li>
</ul>
